{"seconds": 185.0, "exit": 0, "final": "White has now won a full piece (bishop on f3 plus knight on c6 for just a pawn on d3). The position is completely winning.\n\n---\n\n## **Coaching Note**\n\nAfter recapturing Bxf3, your bishop directly attacks Black's c6 knight along the long diagonal. Black's queen must defend it from d6. But if Black greedily recaptures your d3 pawn with Qxd3, the queen abandons that duty\u2014and Bxc6 wins the knight cleanly. Look for recaptures that create multiple threats simultaneously, especially when an opponent's defender can be lured away. This **deflection pattern** wins tons of material at club level.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Bxf3\", \"line\": [\"Bxf3\", \"Qxd3\", \"Bxc6\", \"bxc6\"], \"motifs\": [\"deflection\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/1pp2ppp/1bnq4/4p3/1PP5/3PBb2/4BPPP/Q4RK1 w - - 0 16"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/1pp2ppp/1bnq4/4p3/1PP5/3PBb2/4BPPP/Q4RK1 w - - 0 16"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/1pp2ppp/1bnq4/4p3/1PP5/3PBb2/4BPPP/Q4RK1 w - - 0 16"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/1pp2ppp/1bnq4/4p3/1PP5/3PBb2/4BPPP/Q4RK1 w - - 0 16", "move": "Bxf3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/1pp2ppp/1bnq4/4p3/1PP5/3PBb2/4BPPP/Q4RK1 w - - 0 16", "move": "gxf3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/1pp2ppp/1bnq4/4p3/1PP5/3PBb2/4BPPP/Q4RK1 w - - 0 16"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/1pp2ppp/1bnq4/4p3/1PP5/3PBb2/4BPPP/Q4RK1 w - - 0 16", "move": "Qa8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/1pp2ppp/1bnq4/4p3/1PP5/3PBb2/4BPPP/Q4RK1 w - - 0 16", "move": "Bxb6"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/1pp2ppp/1bnq4/4p3/1PP5/3PBb2/4BPPP/Q4RK1 w - - 0 16", "move": "Qxe5"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "5rk1/1pp2ppp/1bnq4/4p3